      "writtenOn": "2023-10-25T23:24:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027d be more correct to put this immediately before the `poll_wait`, since we may mask out the poll event depending on what the value of `procs_in_direct_reclaim` happens to be when the file is first opened (vs when the poll is started). But I guess either way there is a window of time where the value can change before we start the `poll_wait`, resulting in the same situation.",
